(39, 43, NULL, '<p>Among the top 100 biggest wealth creators in the last five years, these seven bluechip stocks from Tata stable have fallen by up to 23% in the last three months amid market downturns, weak Q2FY25 earnings and uninspiring consumption outlook.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 8 bluechip Tata Group scrips in the BSE 100 index viz. Tata Consultancy Services (TCS), Tata Motors, Tata Consumer Products, Tata Steel, Trent, Tata Power Company and Indian Hotels Company (IHCL).</p>', 2, '2024-12-14 03:12:28', NULL, NULL),
