(43, 47, NULL, '<p><img alt=\"Back\" src=\"https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/images/new/icon-back.png\" style=\"height:11px; width:18px\" />Back</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Tata Motors Share Price Highlights : Tata Motors Faces Decline in Stock Performance Today</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><em>10 min read</em>&nbsp;<em>.</em>&nbsp;Updated: 16 Dec 2024, 08:05 PM IST</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.livemint.com/authors/Livemint\"><strong>Livemint</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Tata Motors Share Price Highlights : Tata Motors stock price went down today, 16 Dec 2024, by -0.65 %. The stock closed at 790.6 per share. The stock is currently trading at 785.5 per share. Investors should monitor Tata Motors stock price closely in the coming days and weeks to see how it reacts to the news.</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Tata Motors Share Price Highlights \" src=\"https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2023/06/14/600x338/2-0-749589146-07D10KP007-0_1680333300145_1686719248930_1686719257978.webp\" style=\"height:100%; width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tata Motors Share Price Highlights</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tata Motors Share Price Highlights : On the last trading day, Tata Motors opened at&nbsp;₹792.35 and closed at&nbsp;₹786.30, experiencing a high of&nbsp;₹792.40 and a low of&nbsp;₹775. The company&#39;s market capitalization stands at&nbsp;₹289,465.3 crore. Over the past year, Tata Motors reached a 52-week high of&nbsp;₹1,179.05 and a low of&nbsp;₹693.76. The BSE recorded a trading volume of 508,033 shares for the day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Disclaimer</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>16 Dec 2024, 08:05:19 PM IST</em></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><em>Tata Motors Live Updates: Shareholding information</em></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Tata Motors Live Updates: Tata Motors has a 10.58% MF holding &amp; 20.54% FII holding as per filings in the quarter.<br />\r\nThe MF holding has increased from 8.04% in to 10.58% in quarter.<br />\r\nThe FII holding has increased from 18.12% in to 20.54% in quarter.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>16 Dec 2024, 07:30:46 PM IST</em></p>\r\n