(55, 55, NULL, '<h1>Hdfc Bank Share Price Live blog for 20 Dec 2024</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><em>1 min read</em>&nbsp;<em>.</em>&nbsp;Updated: 20 Dec 2024, 08:04 AM IST</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.livemint.com/authors/Livemint\"><strong>Livemint</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Hdfc Bank Share Price Today Live Updates : Hdfc Bank stock price went down today, 20 Dec 2024, by -0.98 %. The stock closed at 1811.2 per share. The stock is currently trading at 1793.45 per share. Investors should monitor Hdfc Bank stock price closely in the coming days and weeks to see how it reacts to the news.</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Hdfc Bank Share Price Today Live Updates\" src=\"https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2023/05/04/600x338/The-Bombay-Stock-Exchange-in-Mumbai---Bloomberg-Ph_1683200468247_1683200494396.jpg\" style=\"height:100%; width:100%\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hdfc Bank Share Price Today Live Updates</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hdfc Bank Share Price Today Live Updates : On the last trading day, HDFC Bank&#39;s stock opened at&nbsp;₹1795.05 and closed at&nbsp;₹1811.20, reflecting a positive movement. The stock reached a high of&nbsp;₹1800.20 and a low of&nbsp;₹1779 during the session. With a market capitalization of&nbsp;₹13,716.16 crores, the stock remains below its 52-week high of&nbsp;₹1880 and above the 52-week low of&nbsp;₹1363.45. The trading volume on BSE was 186,084 shares.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><em>Disclaimer: This is an AI-generated live blog and has not been edited by LiveMint staff.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p>20 Dec 2024, 08:04:54 AM IST</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Hdfc Bank Share Price Live Updates: Hdfc Bank closed at ₹1811.2 on last trading day &amp; the technical trend suggests Bearish near term outlook</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Hdfc Bank Share Price Live Updates: The stock traded in the range of&nbsp;₹1800.2 &amp;&nbsp;₹1779 yesterday to end at&nbsp;₹1793.45. Following a strong uptrend, the stock is indicating signs of a reversal.</p>', 0, '2024-12-19 21:25:37', NULL, NULL),
(56, 56, NULL, '<h1>Loan against mutual funds: Interest rates of SBI, HDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, others</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Written by&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/etreporter/author-surbhi-khanna-479258713.cms\" target=\"_blank\">Surbhi Khanna</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>,&nbsp;ET Online|</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dec 18, 2024, 11:38:28 AM IST</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Loan against mutual funds\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116424065,width-640,resizemode-4,imgsize-33984/loan-against-mutual-funds.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>1/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Loan against mutual funds</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>It is a financial solution that allows investors to borrow money against their mutual fund units without selling them. It works as an overdraft facility and the interest is charged only on the amount availed as credit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>iStock</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://epaper.indiatimes.com/wealth_edition.cms?utm_source=wealth&amp;utm_medium=slideshow&amp;utm_campaign=nudge#wealthedition\"><img alt=\"Wealth edition\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-100844695,width-1280,resizemode-4/a.jpg\" /></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Not all banks offer this facility\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116424056,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-74240/not-all-banks-offer-this-facility.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>2/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Not all banks offer this facility</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Many banks offer this facility to the investors. The banks are registered with Computer Age Management Solution Private Limited (CAMS). Here is a breakup of interest rate offered by different banks and the EMI amount on loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years (Source: BankBazaar)<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"ICICI Bank\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116424038,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-10446/icici-bank.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>3/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>ICICI Bank</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>ICICI Bank offers an interest of 11.50% and the EMI amount is Rs 32,976 on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ETMarkets.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Axis Bank\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116424017,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-73448/axis-bank.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>4/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Axis Bank</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Axis Bank offers an interest of 11.49% and the EMI amount is Rs 32,971 on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Reuters</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://popup.taboola.com/en/?template=colorbox&amp;utm_source=timesinternetlimited-economictimes&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=thumbnails-300x250:Mid%20Photo%20Thumbnails%201:\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://popup.taboola.com/en/?template=colorbox&amp;utm_source=timesinternetlimited-economictimes&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=thumbnails-300x250:Mid%20Photo%20Thumbnails%201:\" target=\"_blank\">by Taboola</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>You May Like<a href=\"https://hiranandanigoldenwillows.in/?utm_source=Taboola&amp;utm_medium=Desktop&amp;utm_campaign=GoldenWillows-LP-2bhk-Oct24-Taboola-Desktop&amp;cstm_ppc_channel=Taboola-Desktop&amp;cstm_ppc_campaign=GoldenWillows-LP-2bhk-Oct24-Taboola-Desktop&amp;cstm_ppc_placement={placement}#tblciGiBJrSwbLIJp1V2G_xvB3-08YRtODxQ7_4QkL65J3F-7HyDX_FIo3reb7cqB7NPyATDegGQ\" target=\"_blank\">Own Your Premium 2 BHK Dream HomeHiranandani|</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://popup.taboola.com/en/?template=colorbox&amp;utm_source=timesinternetlimited-economictimes&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_content=thumbnails-300x250:Mid%20Photo%20Thumbnails%201:\" target=\"_blank\">Sponsored</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn More</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Kotak Mahindra Bank\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116423997,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-32008/kotak-mahindra-bank.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>5/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Kotak Mahindra Bank</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kotak Mahindra Bank offers an interest of 8.50% and the EMI amount is Rs 31,568 on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Agencies</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Bank of Baroda\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116423986,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-10078/bank-of-baroda.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>6/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Bank of Baroda</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Bank of Baroda offers an interest of 9.90% and the EMI amount is Rs 32,220 on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>IANS</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"SBI\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116423952,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-10082/sbi.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>7/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>SBI</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>State Bank of India offers an interest of 10.05% and the EMI amount is Rs 32,291 on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ETMarkets.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"HDFC Bank\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116423934,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-36148/hdfc-bank.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>8/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>HDFC Bank</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>HDFC Bank offers an interest of 10.08% and the EMI amount is Rs 33,305 on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.<br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Agencies</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"NBFCs\" src=\"https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-116423918,width-640,height-480,resizemode-75,imgsize-14974/nbfcs.jpg\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>9/9</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NBFCs</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Three NBFCs - Tata Capital, SMFG India Credit, and IIFL Finance - offer interest between 8-10%. The EMI amount is Rs 31,336, Rs 31,800, and Rs 32,267 respectively on a loan of Rs 10 lakh for three years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>IANS</p>', 0, '2024-12-19 21:48:12', NULL, NULL),
