I Card 13.52 ICICI Bank 12.77 Axis Bank 8.6 Citi India 2.55 Source: RBI &quot;THE ACQUISITION STRENGTHENS OUR MARKET POSITION, REDUCES THE GAP IN KEY SEGMENTS WITH PEERS, AND PROVIDES AN OPPORTUNITY TO ACCELERATE RETAIL BUSINESS GROWTH&quot; Amitabh Chaudhry, MD &amp; CEO, Axis Bank PAGE 4 WHEN LIFE COMES FULL CIRCLE WITH CITI DEAL where it does not have the necessary with our broader strategic reposition- scale to compete. &quot;As we move forward with this transaction, India remains a key insti- tutional market for Citi,&quot; said Peter Babej, Citi Asia Pacific CEO. &quot;In line ing, we will continue to support our institutional clients in this core market and across APAC, delivering the full power of our global network to enable their growth,&quot; he added. Turn to Page 6 ▸</p>', 6, '2025-01-01 01:37:39', '1280', '1115'),
