(93, 94, 257, '<p>Tata Motors is offering massive discounts of up to Rs 1.75 lakh on its cars in November 2025. The list of models includes Harrier, Safari, Curvv, Altroz, and more. The offers by the brand on these models include cash discounts, exchange bonuses, corporate offers, and more, depending on the dealership. All of this comes while the automaker is preparing to launch its new Sierra in the country. Here we take a look at the offers on various models on sale. Tata Harrier, Safari Tata dealerships are offering mid-spec Adventure trims for the Harrier and Safari with discounts of up to Rs 1.75 lakh. The entry-level Smart trims have discounts of up to Rs 50,000, while the lower-spec Pure trims enjoy benefits totaling Rs 1.25 lakh.</p>', 0, '2025-11-22 08:03:21', '614', '965'),
(94, 95, 259, '<p>Hyundai Motor has unveiled the Crater Concept at the AutoMobility LA 2025. The model presents the concept of a compact off-road SUV designed to tackle tough terrain. The concept might go into production and is a preview of a future production model. It has been designed at the South Korean automaker&#39;s Hyundai America Technical Centre in Irvine, California. The Crater Concept features a compact monocoque structure. It is designed for versatility and can handle various terrains. The vehicle boasts steep approach and departure angles ideal for off-road adventures. It is equipped with 18-inch wheels and 33-inch off-road tires that provide excellent traction and ground clearance.</p>', 1, '2025-11-22 08:17:29', '533', '989'),
(95, 96, 260, '<p>Tata Motors is offering massive discounts of up to Rs 1.75 lakh on its cars in November 2025. The list of models includes Harrier, Safari, Curvv, Altroz, and more. The offers by the brand on these models include cash discounts, exchange bonuses, corporate offers, and more, depending on the dealership. All of this comes while the automaker is preparing to launch its new Sierra in the country. Here we take a look at the offers on various models on sale. Tata Harrier, Safari Tata dealerships are offering mid-spec Adventure trims for the Harrier and Safari with discounts of up to Rs 1.75 lakh. The entry-level Smart trims have discounts of up to Rs 50,000, while the lower-spec Pure trims enjoy benefits totaling Rs 1.25 lakh.</p>', 0, '2025-11-24 02:15:11', '614', '965'),
