(110, '596f9b32e0c068e89359499c7ca100d38731228f', '7B06CFB5-3A0D-4264-918D-66AA32DD5B7B', 'feb710658c357b41f9546e7d70c7514d67733cad', NULL, '8db09208b962a274f5d01190de698020d0f04f6c', NULL, NULL, 'Top Center', '', 'Large', 'NCDEX Jeera Falls 20% on Rise in Guj Sowing', 'National Com- modity and Derivatives Ex- change (NCDEX) due largely to a sharp rise in the sowing area in Gujarat, the chief producer of the commodity, following a surge in prices last year. The March contract on Ncdex hovered around *169 per kg on Friday afternoon while the Ja- nuary contract, which is going for delivery, ruled around *212 per kg.', 0, 'NCDEX,Commodity', NULL, '30', '1532000', NULL, '2026-01-26 14:06:37'),
(111, '015304b714940c28695d592c9ac10355d0d9a45f', '7cb2ba5b47b7a34bd50248df55ee9ded9e9e31fb', 'b781218e70d093289d3336894b1840add3798c21', NULL, '8db09208b962a274f5d01190de698020d0f04f6c', NULL, NULL, 'Internet', '', 'Small', 'TCS, Nasdaq vying for NCDEX equity platform vendor deal', 'NCDEX had launched operations in 2003, with commodity derivatives trading being reintroduced by the Vajpayee-led NDA government after a four-decade ban.(Mint)', 0, 'NCDEX,Commodity', NULL, '30', '0', 'https://www.livemint.com/market/stock-market-news/ncdex-equity-derivatives-platform-launch-plans-vendors-funding-11766148643678.html', '2026-01-26 14:08:26'),
(112, '596f9b32e0c068e89359499c7ca100d38731228f', '246E5106-6B3F-4618-A013-9E115A7FC77E', 'e22f23a828596cc93a8728cd7d6352a4b756f6bb', 'cf7c75981e2641f011aabaeba66f7e8eec3fc6cb', '8db09208b962a274f5d01190de698020d0f04f6c', NULL, NULL, 'Bottom', '2E42E9CB-9128-49DA-9C61-2AB02BBDA37B', 'Large', 'NCDEX plans to make commodity derivatives a tool to address NPAs and volatile agri prices', 'National details in futures or options from when pledged as mark to marker commodity exchange is making borrowers.\" Banks can ask their borrowers to hedge the price volatility risk of raw materials or commodities Commodity & Derivatives against which they have taken Exchange Limited (NCDEX), loans in futures market, and in plans to make commodity deriva- options,', 0, 'NCDEX,MCX,Commodity,GOLD', NULL, '30', '698400', NULL, '2026-01-26 14:09:43'),
